    "title": "Cow Cat-Chat Translate",
    "description": "Welcome to use our translation app. We aim to be an all-around translation app that meets users' translation needs in various scenarios. Our app supports multiple translation modes, accurate and fast translation, and adheres to the user-centric R&D concept.\r\nWhy choose our app:\r\n\r\n1) Support multiple translation languages, including but not limited to English, French, etc.\r\n\r\n2) Text translation\r\n\r\n3) Voice translation\r\n\r\n4) Photo translation\r\n\r\n5) Conversation translation\r\n\r\n6) Read translation results\r\n\r\n7) Record translation history\r\n\r\n8) Copy translation results with one click\r\n\r\n9) Collect translation results\r\n\r\nWe hope that our app can be of great help to users with translation needs. Whether it is people traveling abroad or students learning foreign languages, an app that translates a variety of languages \u200b\u200band translates accurately and quickly is very necessary.\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://ecxa.translatorboxkp.com/privacyPolicy.html\r\n\r\nTerms of Service: https://ecxa.translatorboxkp.com/termsOfService.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to use our translation app. We aim to be an all-around translation app that meets users&#39; translation needs in various scenarios. Our app supports multiple translation modes, accurate and fast translation, and adheres to the user-centric R&amp;D concept.<br>Why choose our app:<br><br>1) Support multiple translation languages, including but not limited to English, French, etc.<br><br>2) Text translation<br><br>3) Voice translation<br><br>4) Photo translation<br><br>5) Conversation translation<br><br>6) Read translation results<br><br>7) Record translation history<br><br>8) Copy translation results with one click<br><br>9) Collect translation results<br><br>We hope that our app can be of great help to users with translation needs. Whether it is people traveling abroad or students learning foreign languages, an app that translates a variety of languages \u200b\u200band translates accurately and quickly is very necessary.<br><br>Privacy Policy: https://ecxa.translatorboxkp.com/privacyPolicy.html<br><br>Terms of Service: https://ecxa.translatorboxkp.com/termsOfService.html",
